      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "©2017 American Association for Cancer Research.",
        "AbstractText": "The most comprehensive sequencing effort of sarcomatoid renal cell carcinoma (sRCC) to date reinforces the notion that the sarcomatoid component is closely related to the epithelial component of the cancer. This work also challenges the notion that sRCC evolves from low-grade RCC and identifies potential mediators of sarcomatoid differentiation. Clin Cancer Res; 23(21); 6381-3. ©2017 AACRSee related article by Wang et al., p. 6686."
      },
